>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with {n:Guslam} located at (H-8) on {p:Warrior} to begin the quest.
* Go to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} and find a {p:Treasure Coffer}.
** You can purchase a {@k} {k:Magicked astrolabe} from {n:Churano-Shurano} in {z:Windurst Waters} at (F-8) for 10,000 gil. This allows you to open doors in Eldieme Necropolis by yourself.
* Obtain a {@i:Eld. Coffer Key|1046} {i:Eldieme Coffer Key|Eld. Coffer Key|1046} - farm it or buy it from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}, or simply pick the Treasure Coffer lock as a {p:Thief}. You do not need to be on Warrior when opening this coffer.
** There is a chance that the coffer is in the Northwest section of map 2 (exit 7), which normally requires going to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} and then going south to {z:Batallia Downs} to access the entrance, on a ledge.
*** Alternatively, you can visit this location in {z:Batallia Downs (S)} and examine the {p:Lycopodium (NPC)} to unlock the Sparkling Light shortcut in the present. This can skip the ledge without having to go around.
* You will receive {@k} {k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam}. He will inform you he is unable to repair the gauntlets.
* If this is your first time completing a Boghertz's Hands quest for any job, you must do the following:
** Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
** Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 gil to continue.
* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head to the crates near the AH and Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8) underground beside {n:Digaga}.
* Click on the **???** to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.
* Click on one of the torches to spawn the NM {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine one of the torches for the {@k} {k:Shadow flames}.
* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the **???** again. After the cutscene, the quest is now complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Crawlers' Nest} - {@i:Fighter's Mask|12511} {i:Fighter's Mask|Fighter's Mask|12511}
* {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} - {@i:Fighter's Cuisses|14214} {i:Fighter's Cuisses|Fighter's Cuisses|14214}
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** Borghertz's Warring Hands must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
** You **must** have {p:Warrior} as your main job when you open these coffers.

